<title>UK: ING unit sets 10 bln yen four-year FRN.</title>
<headline>ING unit sets 10 bln yen four-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING VERZEKERINGEN NV</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    BASE	 3M LIBOR  MATURITY    19.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +100 BP   PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 ISS PRICE  104.85    FULL FEES   NONE</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) 10	  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
